  "id": "subjective-prior",
  "term": "subjective prior",
  "definition": "A subjective prior is a person’s pre-existing belief about the state of the world before current sensory information is taken into account. In a Bayesian view of learning and decision-making, this belief is combined with new information to form an updated posterior belief that guides behaviour.",
